# ASTRA — Project License Status

> [!IMPORTANT]
> **LICENSE STATUS: PENDING TEAM SELECTION (RELEASE BLOCKER)**
>
> The formal open-source license for the ASTRA codebase has not yet been selected by the Gravity Brains development team.
> Prior to the official public release of this repository for the NASA Space Apps Challenge 2026, the team must designate an approved open-source license.

### Recommended Open-Source Licenses for Consideration:
1. **MIT License**: Maximizes permissiveness, enabling educational, scientific, and community adoption with standard liability disclaimers.
2. **Apache License 2.0**: Provides permissive usage while granting explicit contributor patent rights and trademark protections.

All third-party libraries, datasets, and fonts bundled or referenced by this project remain under their respective original open-source licenses, detailed in `docs/references/THIRD_PARTY_LICENSES.md`.

